  "contentHtml": "<p>Ⅰ-1. 생물의 특성을 학습한 후 하는 활동으로,</p><p>자신만의 생물을 창조하여 그린 후,</p><p>생물인 이유를 서술하여 옆에 적어주었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>창의성을 발휘에 어려움을 느끼는 학생들에게는</p><p>강아지, 해바라기 사진을 보여준 후 둘 중 하나를 선택하여 그것이 생물인 이유를 적게 하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>시간이 부족하여 많이 서술해놓진 못했지만</p><p>발표할 때는 생물의특성 거의 전부를 적용시켰습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>예시작품입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82400b3a2e291cd5038b352a55ff353bafb637fe\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82400b3a2e291cd5038b352a55ff353bafb637fe\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"562\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3adba0854ba757ea3ecab642158148c7b252c92c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3adba0854ba757ea3ecab642158148c7b252c92c\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"562\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f2b7fe967e855d18cb8aad83c07f24942d493ebd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f2b7fe967e855d18cb8aad83c07f24942d493ebd\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"1333\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/949692e55c1cf58389cf43f5184514f22846d762\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/949692e55c1cf58389cf43f5184514f22846d762\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"750\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd25089fe77d4d38877ea785377a55ebc301d936\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dd25089fe77d4d38877ea785377a55ebc301d936\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"1441\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bfc348e6fb2ab23cda4c2c64e6853a893c871fab\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bfc348e6fb2ab23cda4c2c64e6853a893c871fab\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"1333\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4abcaa8bfbe859377ced48481b8bae1e5b36dcc3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4abcaa8bfbe859377ced48481b8bae1e5b36dcc3\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"1333\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/290460bd8bc5f470c1668aeb9123c746869d5e47\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/290460bd8bc5f470c1668aeb9123c746869d5e47\" data-origin-width=\"914\" data-origin-height=\"524\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ec882dcad2f04325259a90c8f8a5045067e4caf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ec882dcad2f04325259a90c8f8a5045067e4caf\" data-origin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"750\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
